'''Necron's Ladder''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Necron's Ladder''' can be purchased from the {{Zone|Regalia Room}} for {{c|75m}}. As it is a rotating item, it may not be available every [[SkyBlock Year]].

'''Necron's Ladder''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward during [[Raffle of the Century]] event.

==Usage== 
The player can keep '''Necron's Ladder''' in their inventory to track how many {{Item|Necron's Handle}}s they find in [[Dungeon Reward Chest]]s.

If the player has multiple uncompleted '''Necron's Ladders''' in their inventory, only the one with the highest count of handles, or in case of a tie, the first one will be incremented.

Finding {{Item|Necron's Handle|amount=3}}s will allow the player to consume the item and gain a permanent stat bonus of the following:  
*{{stat|hp|+1}}
*{{stat|mf|+1}}
*{{stat|int|+1}}

The player may only gain the bonus once.

